		(property "Placement" "TI SS8.4.1 priority 4: place close to the VBUS pin, same layer as the IC, short trace -- critical for noise filtering. Unlike PMID/SYS (priority 1), the spec sets no one-bulk-cap-in-parallel requirement here -- both 10uF bulk caps (C301, C302) can be placed further away, with no distinction between them. Cap ground routes through at least 2 vias to the internal ground plane, back to the IC GND pin."
