		(property "Note" "QON_N switch node ESD/noise filter -- not classical debounce (QON is level-sensitive, a wake event isn't disrupted by contact bounce). This exposed user-facing button's trace benefits from local filtering the internal-only SW1/SW2 buttons don't need. 100nF sized (not 1uF like SW1/SW2's caps) because it pairs with QON's much weaker internal ~200k RQON pull-up -- release recovery time constant stays ~20ms either way."
			(at 445.77 230.505 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
